!
! Default MODEL_SPEC: first and second ionisation stages for H, O, Si, Ca.
! Fe extended to Fe IV. H has only HI (single electron).
! He II (He2) REMOVED - it requires ~1e14x population correction from LTE
! in the cool diluted SN_A ejecta, driving convergence instability.
! He is represented by He I only (He II ionization potential 54.4 eV is
! not reached in this regime).
! O II pruned to the three 2p3 terms (21-Sep-2026): the 2s2p4 superlevels
! (14.9 and 20.6 eV, far-UV transitions only) were Boltzmann-dead at the
! hydro temperatures yet pinned MAXCH at ~10-14% via the SCALE-capped
! collapse of their populations (prune_stalled_levels.py, TypeIIn_KNOP2).
!
8,15,15       [HI_ISF]          ! H I
7,15,15       [HeI_ISF]         ! He I
15,20,48      [OI_ISF]          ! O I
3,3,5         [O2_ISF]          ! O II (2p3 terms only; was 4,5,10)
15,20,38      [SkI_ISF]         ! Si I
10,20,20      [Sk2_ISF]         ! Si II
1,1,1         [CaI_ISF]         ! Ca I
15,17,40      [Ca2_ISF]         ! Ca II
15,25,87      [FeI_ISF]         ! Fe I
20,30,113     [Fe2_ISF]         ! Fe II
10,16,50      [FeIII_ISF]       ! Fe III
4,3,10        [FeIV_ISF]        ! Fe IV
